<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Jan-Apr c/a deficit down to 317.2 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal Jan-Apr c/a deficit down to 317.2 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's current account deficit from January to April this year fell to 317.2 billion escudos from 407.4 billion in the same year-ago period, the central bank said in its monthly report for May.</p>
<p>In April, the current account deficit dropped to 16.9 billion escudos from 128.0 billion in the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>It said an increase in transfers from the European Union was a reason for the narrowing in the deficit.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
